        <h1>The Effect of High LET Radiation on Differentiation and Tumorigenesis in the Human Hematopoietic System: Modeling in vitro and in vivo for Risk Assessment</h1>
        <div class="meta-id">Record ID: NNX14AC27G</div>
      </div>

